{"path":"contact.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1" />
  <title>Reach Out — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>
  <style>
    :root{--bg:#FCFBFF;--accent:#6B4EFF;--muted:#6C6C80;--card:#FFFFFF;--glass:rgba(255,255,255,0.6);--shadow:0 8px 30px rgba(15,12,40,0.06);--success:#0ABF7A}
    html,body{height:100%;margin:0;font-family:Inter,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,"Segoe UI",Roboto,"Helvetica Neue",Arial; color:#221; background:linear-gradient(180deg,#FBF8FF 0%, #F7FBFF 100%);}
    .wrap{max-width:1100px;margin:36px auto;padding:28px}
    header{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:18px}
    .logo{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px}
    .logo svg{width:44px;height:44px}
    nav{display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:center}
    nav a{color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;padding:8px 10px;border-radius:8px;font-weight:600}
    nav a.active,nav a:hover{background:var(--glass);color:var(--accent)}

    .hero{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 360px;gap:22px;align-items:start;margin-top:22px}
    .lead{background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(107,78,255,0.06),rgba(107,78,255,0.02));padding:22px;border-radius:14px;box-shadow:var(--shadow)}
    h1{margin:0 0 8px 0;font-size:22px}
    p.lead-desc{margin:0;color:var(--muted)}

    /* pattern float */
    .pattern{position:relative;height:120px;overflow:visible}
    .pattern svg{position:absolute;right:-30px;top:-20px;opacity:0.16}

    /* Mood-to-Method */
    .mood-grid{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px}
    .moods{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap}
    .mood{border:1px solid rgba(34,34,34,0.06);padding:10px 14px;border-radius:10px;background:#fff;cursor:pointer;transition:transform .18s,var(--);display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px}
    .mood:hover{transform:translateY(-4px)}
    .mood.active{background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--accent),#9F79FF);color:#fff}

    .method-card{margin-top:12px;padding:16px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fff, #FCFAFF);box-shadow:var(--shadow);min-height:120px;transition:all 300ms ease}
    .method-title{font-weight:700;font-size:18px;margin:0}
    .method-desc{color:var(--muted);margin:6px 0 0 0}

    .cta-row{display:flex;gap:10px;margin-top:12px}
    .btn{padding:10px 14px;border-radius:10px;border:0;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer}
    .btn.primary{background:var(--accent);color:#fff}
    .btn.ghost{background:#fff;border:1px solid rgba(34,34,34,0.06)}

    /* Pricing comparator */
    .pricing{margin-top:18px;padding:14px;background:#fff;border-radius:12px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 260px;gap:14px;box-shadow:var(--shadow)}
    .pricing-left{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px}
    .toggle{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;padding:6px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#F5F3FF,#FFF);border-radius:999px;width:max-content}
    .toggle button{border:0;background:transparent;padding:8px 12px;border-radius:999px;cursor:pointer;font-weight:700}
    .toggle button.active{background:var(--accent);color:#fff}
    .plans{display:flex;gap:10px}
    .plan{padding:12px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid rgba(34,34,34,0.04);background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fff,#FBFBFF);width:160px}
    .plan-name{font-weight:700}
    .price{font-size:20px;font-weight:800;margin-top:6px}
    .price small{font-weight:600;color:var(--muted);font-size:12px}

    /* contact form */
    form.contact{margin-top:18px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:10px;background:#fff;padding:14px;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:var(--shadow)}
    .full{grid-column:1/-1}
    label{display:block;font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:6px}
    input,textarea,select{width:100%;padding:10px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid rgba(34,34,34,0.06);font-size:15px}
    textarea{min-height:110px;resize:vertical}
    .disclaimer{font-size:12px;color:#8a7f9f;margin-top:10px}
    .footer{margin-top:22px;color:var(--muted);font-size:14px}

    @media (max-width:900px){.hero{grid-template-columns:1fr}.pricing{grid-template-columns:1fr}.wrap{padding:18px}}
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="wrap">
    <header>
      <div class="logo">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true">
          <rect width="48" height="48" rx="10" fill="#F6F4FF"/>
          <circle cx="24" cy="18" r="6" fill="#6B4EFF"/>
          <path d="M8 34c6-8 16-10 24-6" stroke="#9F79FF" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"/>
        </svg>
        <div>
          <div style="font-weight:800">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>
          <div style="font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)">{{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <nav aria-label="Main navigation">
        <a href="index.html">Home</a>
        <a href="events.html">Gatherings</a>
        <a href="private-sessions.html">Private Voyages</a>
        <a href="pricing.html">Rhythms</a>
        <a href="about.html">Stories</a>
        <a href="contact.html" class="active">Reach</a>
      </nav>
    </header>

    <section class="hero">
      <div class="lead" aria-labelledby="contact-heading">
        <h1 id="contact-heading">Let us tune in — reach a human</h1>
        <p class="lead-desc">Use this page to ask about upcoming gatherings, private bookings, accessibility needs, or whether a session is right for your situation. We'll respond within 48 hours at {{EMAIL}} or call us at {{PHONE}}.</p>

        <div class="pattern" aria-hidden="true">
          <!-- unique inline svg pattern for this chunk -->
          <svg width="240" height="120" viewBox="0 0 240 120" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
            <defs>
              <linearGradient id="g1" x1="0" x2="1">
                <stop offset="0" stop-color="#F0EEFF" />
                <stop offset="1" stop-color="#FFF" />
              </linearGradient>
            </defs>
            <rect x="0" y="0" width="240" height="120" fill="url(#g1)" rx="16" />
            <g fill="#EDE6FF" opacity="0.8">
              <circle cx="40" cy="30" r="10" />
              <circle cx="80" cy="60" r="6" />
              <circle cx="120" cy="20" r="8" />
              <circle cx="160" cy="50" r="5" />
              <circle cx="200" cy="30" r="9" />
            </g>
            <path d="M10 110 C60 80, 120 140, 230 100" stroke="#D7CBFF" stroke-width="6" stroke-linecap="round" fill="none" opacity="0.5"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
      </div>

      <aside>
        <div style="background:#fff;padding:12px;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:var(--shadow)">
          <div style="font-weight:800">Start by sharing your mood</div>
          <div class="mood-grid">
            <div class="moods" role="tablist" aria-label="Select mood">
              <button class="mood" data-key="tired" role="tab">Heavy + Tired</button>
              <button class="mood" data-key="tangled" role="tab">Tangled + Busy</button>
              <button class="mood" data-key="restless" role="tab">Restless + Wired</button>
              <button class="mood" data-key="lifted" role="tab">Celebratory + Open</button>
            </div>

            <div class="method-card" id="methodCard" role="region" aria-live="polite">
              <div class="method-title" id="methodTitle">Gentle Resonance</div>
              <div class="method-desc" id="methodDesc">A slow, cradle-like sound journey focused on long tones and guided breathing. Great for unwinding after long days.</div>
              <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-top:12px">
                <div style="font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)">Recommended: small-group evenings · 60 min</div>
                <div class="cta-row">
                  <a id="methodCTA" class="btn primary" href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
                  <button class="btn ghost" id="methodMore">Details</button>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>

          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Pricing comparator sits here as a compact tool for visitors curious about cost options -->
        <div class="pricing" aria-hidden="false">
          <div class="pricing-left">
            <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between">
              <div style="font-weight:800">Investment snapshot</div>
              <div class="toggle" role="tablist" aria-label="Toggle pricing view">
                <button class="toggle-btn active" data-mode="monthly">Monthly</button>
                <button class="toggle-btn" data-mode="package">Pack</button>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="plans" aria-hidden="false">
              <div class="plan">
                <div class="plan-name">Horizon Series</div>
                <div class="price" data-month="45" data-pack="160">$<span class="num">45</span><small> / mo</small></div>
              </div>

              <div class="plan">
                <div class="plan-name">Lumen Intensive</div>
                <div class="price" data-month="85" data-pack="320">$<span class="num">85</span><small> / mo</small></div>
              </div>

              <div class="plan">
                <div class="plan-name">Private Voyage</div>
                <div class="price" data-month="120" data-pack="420">$<span class="num">120</span><small> / mo</small></div>
              </div>
            </div>

          </div>

          <div style="padding:12px;border-left:1px dashed rgba(34,34,34,0.04);display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center">
            <div style="font-weight:700">Compare on the fly</div>
            <div style="font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:6px">Switch between monthly subscriptions and pre-paid packages. Prices animate to show real differences.</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </section>

    <form class="contact" id="contactForm" aria-labelledby="contact-heading">
      <div>
        <label for="name">Your name</label>
        <input id="name" name="name" type="text" required />
      </div>
      <div>
        <label for="email">Email</label>
        <input id="email" name="email" type="email" required />
      </div>
      <div>
        <label for="phone">Phone</label>
        <input id="phone" name="phone" type="tel" placeholder="Optional" />
      </div>
      <div>
        <label for="when">Best time to reach</label>
        <select id="when" name="when">
          <option>Morning</option>
          <option>Afternoon</option>
          <option>Evening</option>
        </select>
      </div>

      <div class="full">
        <label for="message">Message</label>
        <textarea id="message" name="message" placeholder="Tell us about the event, accessibility needs, or questions." required></textarea>
      </div>

      <input type="hidden" id="moodInput" name="mood" value="tired" />
      <div class="full" style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center">
        <div>
          <button type="submit" class="btn primary">Send inquiry</button>
          <button type="button" class="btn ghost" id="clearBtn">Clear</button>
        </div>
        <div style="font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)">Or call <a href="tel:{{PHONE}}">{{PHONE}}</a></div>
      </div>

      <div class="full disclaimer">
        <strong>Contraindications & safety:</strong> Sound experiences often use sustained tones and low frequency vibration. If you have uncontrolled epilepsy, serious cardiac conditions, recent surgery, are pregnant without medical clearance, or have other medical concerns, please consult a healthcare provider before booking. If you use a pacemaker or are unsure about vibrational therapy, contact us at {{EMAIL}} for tailored guidance. This page is informational and not medical advice.
      </div>
    </form>

    <div class="footer">
      <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap">
        <div>Prefer RSVP? Visit <a href="events.html">Gatherings</a> or book a private session at <a href="private-sessions.html">Private Voyages</a>.</div>
        <div>Questions: <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}">{{EMAIL}}</a></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <script>
    // Mood-to-Method mapping
    const methods = {
      tired:{title:'Gentle Resonance',desc:'Slow, long tones with guided breath and soft chimes — for deep unwinding and restful nervous system downshift.',cta:'Book a Gentle Session',link:'{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}#gentle'},
      tangled:{title:'Focused Weave',desc:'Shorter structured sets with grounding pulses and voice cues that help reorganize attention and ease scattered thinking.',cta:'Reserve a Focused Weave',link:'{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}#weave'},
      restless:{title:'Kinetic Flow',desc:'Dynamic rhythmic textures and movement prompts to help release agitation and move energy through the body.',cta:'Join a Kinetic Flow',link:'{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}#flow'},
      lifted:{title:'Lumen Circle',desc:'Bright resonances and communal harmonics meant to amplify celebration and collective presence.',cta:'RSVP to a Lumen Circle',link:'{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}#lumen'}
    };

    // Initialize mood selection
    const moodButtons = document.querySelectorAll('.mood');
    const methodTitle = document.getElementById('methodTitle');
    const methodDesc = document.getElementById('methodDesc');
    const methodCTA = document.getElementById('methodCTA');
    const moodInput = document.getElementById('moodInput');

    function setMood(key,focus=false){
      moodButtons.forEach(b=>b.classList.toggle('active', b.dataset.key===key));
      const m = methods[key];
      methodTitle.textContent = m.title;
      methodDesc.textContent = m.desc;
      methodCTA.textContent = m.cta;
      methodCTA.href = m.link || '{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}';
      moodInput.value = key;
      if(focus) methodCTA.focus();
    }

    moodButtons.forEach(b=>{
      b.addEventListener('click',()=>setMood(b.dataset.key,true));
    });

    // Default mood
    setMood('tired');

    // Pricing comparator
    const toggleBtns = document.querySelectorAll('.toggle-btn');
    let pricingMode = 'monthly';
    const priceEls = document.querySelectorAll('.price');

    function animateNumber(el,from,to){
      const span = el.querySelector('.num');
      const start = performance.now();
      const dur = 420;
      function tick(now){
        const t = Math.min(1,(now-start)/dur);
        const value = Math.round(from + (to-from)*t);
        span.textContent = value;
        if(t<1) requestAnimationFrame(tick);
      }
      requestAnimationFrame(tick);
    }

    toggleBtns.forEach(btn=>{
      btn.addEventListener('click',()=>{
        toggleBtns.forEach(b=>b.classList.toggle('active',b===btn));
        const mode = btn.dataset.mode;
        if(mode===pricingMode) return;
        pricingMode = mode;
        priceEls.forEach(pe=>{
          const from = parseInt(pe.querySelector('.num').textContent,10)||0;
          const to = mode==='monthly' ? parseInt(pe.dataset.month,10) : parseInt(pe.dataset.pack,10);
          const small = pe.querySelector('small');
          if(mode==='monthly') small.textContent = ' / mo'; else small.textContent = ' / pack';
          animateNumber(pe,from,to);
        });
      });
    });

    // Form handling (mock)
    const form = document.getElementById('contactForm');
    form.addEventListener('submit',e=>{
      e.preventDefault();
      const data = new FormData(form);
      // Basic validation done by browser; show faux success
      const name = data.get('name');
      const success = document.createElement('div');
      success.style.marginTop = '10px';
      success.style.padding = '12px';
      success.style.borderRadius = '8px';
      success.style.background = 'linear-gradient(90deg,#F0FFF4,#F7FFFA)';
      success.style.border = '1px solid rgba(10,191,122,0.12)';
      success.textContent = `Thanks ${name || 'friend'} — we received your message and will reply at ${data.get('email')}.`;
      form.parentNode.insertBefore(success, form.nextSibling);
      form.reset();
      setMood('tired');
    });

    document.getElementById('clearBtn').addEventListener('click',()=>{
      form.reset();
      setMood('tired');
    });

    // Method details quicklink
    document.getElementById('methodMore').addEventListener('click',()=>{
      alert('Details: We can adapt session length, volume, and tactile options. Ask about accessibility and contra-indications when booking.');
    });
  </script>
</body>
</html>"} 
{"path":"README.md","content":"Contact page and usage notes for the sound bath template chunk.

Files included in this chunk:
- contact.html : The contact & interactive utility page.

Purpose:
- This page provides a friendly contact experience while showcasing two small client-side utilities:
  1) Pricing Comparator: toggles between monthly and package pricing with animated number transitions.
  2) Mood-to-Method selector: choose a current state and the recommended approach, description, and CTA update dynamically.

Placeholders to replace in a production build (left as tokens):
- {{BUSINESS_NAME}}
- {{TAGLINE}} (not used on this page but available across the site)
- {{PHONE}}
- {{EMAIL}}
- {{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}
- {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}
- {{CITY}}
- {{STATE}}

Notes on behavior:
- The contact form is a mock/example: it does client-side validation and then displays a faux success message. Integrate with your server or form-backend as needed.
- The mood selector writes the chosen mood into a hidden input named "mood" ready for server consumption.
- The pricing comparator reads prices from data attributes (data-month and data-pack) and animates numbers on toggle.

Accessibility & safety:
- Buttons and controls include basic aria attributes. The page contains a contraindications disclaimer; adapt the language to match your legal/research requirements.

Testing:
- Open contact.html in a modern browser. Click the mood buttons to see the method card change and CTA update.
- Toggle pricing between "Monthly" and "Pack" to watch animated prices.
- Submit the form to view the mocked success banner.

Integration:
- Hook form.submit to your endpoint or replace the success block to perform a fetch/AJAX call.
- Replace placeholder tokens with your real values during build-time.

Design:
- No external fonts or assets are required for this page; the visual pattern is embedded inline as an SVG.

Contact for developers:
- This chunk was built to be self-contained. If you need additional modularization (separate JS/CSS), extract the <script> and <style> blocks into files and reference them from the pages that require these utilities.
"} 
BUNDLE_END
